  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Following his boss's orders, Muranishi approaches Ono, the company's star salesman. Instead of talking about encyclopedias, Ono tests Muranishi on Alfred Hitchcock, pop music, and singing in the street. Listen to how this strange audition unfolds.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あの、小野さんから営業のことを学べって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "ヒッチコックが死んだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "無愛想ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "正気か？お前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "サイコは傑作ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "お前、音楽は何を聴くんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "最近は洋楽です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "日本人ならこれだろ。歌えよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "僕らは自由だね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "よし、合格だ。明日から教えてやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "じゃあ、さようなら。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Ono speaks in rapid, confident plain speech while Muranishi stays respectful. Let's walk through the highlights.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あの、小野さんから営業のことを学べって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Um, I was told to learn about sales from you, Ono-san.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "ヒッチコックが死んだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hitchcock died.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "無愛想ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''That is rather blunt, is it not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ですね",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "正気か？お前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Are you out of your mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "お前、音楽は何を聴くんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of music do you listen to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "最近は洋楽です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lately, Western music.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "日本人ならこれだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''If you are Japanese, it has to be this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "僕らは自由だね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''We are free, are we not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "よし、合格だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, you pass.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "明日から教えてやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will teach you starting tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Thank you, I look forward to working with you.'",
      "gap": 0.9
